   "source_html": "<span class=\"padya\" id=\"901e938c-4dd4-4415-b03f-16c009cc9fb2\">रोहिण्यामर्धरात्रे तु यदा</span><span class=\"inline\" id=\"60f51970-3f4d-44e2-860b-19aa37f0735c\">कालाष्टमी<span class=\"pathantara\" data-note=\"“कालाष्टमी” - इति कृ पाठः, “काळाष्टमी”- इति गो पाठः\"><a class=\"pathantara-ref\" href=\"#note-pathantara-1\" id=\"ref-pathantara-1\" style=\"margin-left: 2px;\">[1]</a></span></span><span class=\"inline\" id=\"cf8942fd-8578-40a6-9617-6b4c6ce9ffef\">भवेत्।</span><span class=\"padya\" id=\"0d69ed73-3cd4-45ff-a385-bab84080338d\">जयन्ती नाम सा प्रोक्ता</span><span class=\"inline\" id=\"7119f3bc-d89c-4f2b-ae86-585c262cf324\">सर्वपापप्रणाशनी<span class=\"pathantara\" data-note=\"“सर्वपापप्रणाशनी” - इति कृ पाठः, “सर्वपापप्रणाशनम्”- इति गो पाठः\"><a class=\"pathantara-ref\" href=\"#note-pathantara-2\" id=\"ref-pathantara-2\" style=\"margin-left: 2px;\">[2]</a></span></span><span class=\"inline\" id=\"dc81a0e7-fb19-4d20-a23b-a627cdcbad95\">॥ १॥</span><span class=\"padya\" id=\"f4eb679b-2695-4fe4-b851-95dfc6c2146c\">यस्यां जातो हरिः साक्षान्निशीथे भगवानजः।</span>"
  },
  {
