   "source_html": "<span class=\"padya\" id=\"67cf58b5-d327-4c2c-aa88-e37666bc61bc\">तस्मात्</span><span class=\"inline\" id=\"ffe868a7-efda-4d48-b694-1b4331d5a402\">तद्दिनमत्यन्तं<span class=\"pathantara\" data-note=\"“तद्दिनमत्यन्तं” - इति कृ पाठः, “तद्दिनमत्यर्थं”- इति गो पाठः\"><a class=\"pathantara-ref\" href=\"#note-pathantara-3\" id=\"ref-pathantara-3\" style=\"margin-left: 2px;\">[3]</a></span></span><span class=\"inline\" id=\"bfe0d1e1-bf52-45f7-ab97-deb8f1372d9f\">पुण्यं पापहरं परम्॥ २॥<span class=\"pathantara\" data-note=\"“पापहरं स्मृतम्” - पा। “पापहानिकरं परम्” पा\"><a class=\"pathantara-ref\" href=\"#note-pathantara-4\" id=\"ref-pathantara-4\" style=\"margin-left: 2px;\">[4]</a></span></span><span class=\"padya\" id=\"f69de205-d5ff-4630-a9ff-abc6008a75d6\">तस्मात् सर्वैरुपोष्या सा जयन्ती नाम वै सदा।</span><span class=\"padya\" id=\"97a253d2-55da-49a1-9300-912c7ae8afb4\">द्विजातिभिर्विशेषेण तद्भक्तैश्च</span><span class=\"inline\" id=\"fc00c9c3-dfcd-4307-9aaf-c136c7a39ff4\">विशेषतः<span class=\"pathantara\" data-note=\"“विशेषतः” - इति कृ पाठः, “विधानतः”- इति गो पाठः\"><a class=\"pathantara-ref\" href=\"#note-pathantara-5\" id=\"ref-pathantara-5\" style=\"margin-left: 2px;\">[5]</a></span></span><span class=\"inline\" id=\"bd79f2fe-39fa-493d-9f98-63a15b59badb\">॥ ३॥</span>"
  },
  {
